    "grading": "すべて選ぶ{$\\ce{Zn^2+}$|$\\ce{Cu^2+}$|$\\ce{Mn^2+}$|$\\ce{Ca^2+}$|$\\ce{Ni^2+}$|$\\ce{Ag+}$}=1,3,5"
